Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Compare completed tasks with actual scans and custody events, apply approved exact adjustments, and verify conservation across locations. Preserve unresolved differences and distinguish a found item from a fulfilled customer order.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
